{"page":214,"verses":[{"verse_key":"10:43","surah":10,"ayah":43,"ar_uthmani":"وَمِنْهُم مَّن يَنظُرُ إِلَيْكَ ۚ أَفَأَنتَ تَهْدِى ٱلْعُمْىَ وَلَوْ كَانُوا۟ لَا يُبْصِرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Some of them look at you: but can you guide the blind if they will not see?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمِنْهُم","en_gloss":"And among them","transliteration":"wamin'hum","verse_key":"10:43"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَّن","en_gloss":"(are some) who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"10:43"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يَنظُرُ","en_gloss":"look","transliteration":"yanẓuru","verse_key":"10:43"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِلَيْكَ ۚ","en_gloss":"at you","transliteration":"ilayka","verse_key":"10:43"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَفَأَنتَ","en_gloss":"But (can) you","transliteration":"afa-anta","verse_key":"10:43"},{"pos":6,"ar":"تَهْدِى","en_gloss":"guide","transliteration":"tahdī","verse_key":"10:43"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْعُمْىَ","en_gloss":"the blind","transliteration":"l-ʿum'ya","verse_key":"10:43"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَلَوْ","en_gloss":"even though","transliteration":"walaw","verse_key":"10:43"},{"pos":9,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"they [were]","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"10:43"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"10:43"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يُبْصِرُونَ","en_gloss":"see","transliteration":"yub'ṣirūna","verse_key":"10:43"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٤٣","en_gloss":"(43)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"10:43"}]},{"verse_key":"10:44","surah":10,"ayah":44,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ لَا يَظْلِمُ ٱلنَّاسَ شَيْـًٔا وَلَـٰكِنَّ ٱلنَّاسَ أَنفُسَهُمْ يَظْلِمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God does not wrong people at all- it is they who wrong themselves.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"10:44"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"10:44"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(does) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"10:44"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَظْلِمُ","en_gloss":"wrong","transliterat