some","transliteration":"baʿḍa","verse_key":"10:46"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"(of) that which","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"10:46"},{"pos":5,"ar":"نَعِدُهُمْ","en_gloss":"We promised them","transliteration":"naʿiduhum","verse_key":"10:46"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"10:46"},{"pos":7,"ar":"نَتَوَفَّيَنَّكَ","en_gloss":"We cause you to die","transliteration":"natawaffayannaka","verse_key":"10:46"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَإِلَيْنَا","en_gloss":"then to Us","transliteration":"fa-ilaynā","verse_key":"10:46"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مَرْجِعُهُمْ","en_gloss":"(is) their return","transliteration":"marjiʿuhum","verse_key":"10:46"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"10:46"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"10:46"},{"pos":12,"ar":"شَهِيدٌ","en_gloss":"(is) a Witness","transliteration":"shahīdun","verse_key":"10:46"},{"pos":13,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"over","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"10:46"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"10:46"},{"pos":15,"ar":"يَفْعَلُونَ","en_gloss":"they do","transliteration":"yafʿalūna","verse_key":"10:46"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٤٦","en_gloss":"(46)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"10:46"}]},{"verse_key":"10:47","surah":10,"ayah":47,"ar_uthmani":"وَلِكُلِّ أُمَّةٍ رَّسُولٌ ۖ فَإِذَا جَآءَ رَسُولُهُمْ قُضِىَ بَيْنَهُم بِٱلْقِسْطِ وَهُمْ لَا يُظْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Every community is sent a mes-senger, and when their messenger comes, they will be judged justly; they will not be wronged.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلِكُلِّ","en_gloss":"And for every","transliteration":"walikulli","verse_key":"10:47"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أُمَّةٍۢ","en_gloss":"nation","transliteration":"ummatin","verse_key":"10:47"},{"pos":3,"ar":"رَّسُولٌۭ ۖ","en_gloss":"(is) a Messenger","transliteration":"rasūlun","verse_key":"10:47"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَإِذَا","en_gloss":"So when","